# ETSI ITS (examples/asn1/its.asn1, all three modules:
# ITS-Container, DENM-PDU-Descriptions, CAM-PDU-Descriptions): no hand
# vectors, only the reference deviations for its random-value check.
#
# companyName UTF8String (SIZE (1..24)): asn1c applies the SIZE as a
# constrained length, where X.691 10.3.7 and 30.6 make it unconstrained, in
# octets (see tests/x691/strings.vec, UtfSized).
deviates asn1c DangerousGoodsExtended
# and the types that hold a DangerousGoodsExtended: every value asn1c
# decodes differently or rejects in them has a companyName (pycrate still
# checks them)
deviates asn1c StationaryVehicleContainer
deviates asn1c AlacarteContainer
deviates asn1c DENM
deviates asn1c DecentralizedEnvironmentalNotificationMessage

# DigitalMap ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..256)) OF ReferencePosition: asn1c rejects
# one of 201 elements or more, its own encoding and pycrate's included
# ("Decode failed at byte 34", the second element); 200 it decodes. The length
# is 8 bits here (X.691 11.9.3.3 in UNALIGNED), c8 for 201.
deviates asn1c DigitalMap

# rasn 0.28 encodes a list of a size outside an extensible SIZE's root
# otherwise than X.691 20.4 and 11.9 (PositionOfPillars, SIZE (1..3, ...), of
# 4: 826eaa68 it sends as fbaa9a, as with tests/x691/sizes.vec's ExtList); it
# decodes X.691's. And the types that hold such a list.
deviates-encode rasn PositionOfPillars
deviates-encode rasn RestrictedTypes
deviates-encode rasn ReferenceDenms
deviates-encode rasn ImpactReductionContainer
deviates-encode rasn RoadWorksContainerExtended
deviates-encode rasn AlacarteContainer
deviates-encode rasn DENM
deviates-encode rasn DecentralizedEnvironmentalNotificationMessage
